---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftGardenPlan
---
Construct a GardenPlan draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Propose varied planting and shared-space concepts consistent with supplied guidance and member goals. Include creative communal uses, preserve access paths and resource limits, and identify tradeoffs rather than optimizing only one member’s preferences.
